      <Description>k__BackingField: 'A .NET Core Global Tool (Command-Line-Tool)
        that allows restoring NuGet packages managed by NuGetForUnity

        before
        starting Unity e.g. before building a Unity project on a build server.

        The
        tool only restores the NuGet packages, they are managed by the NuGetForUnity
        Unity Editor plug-in,

        so you still need to install the NuGetForUnity
        tool in Unity to install new packages and to ensure that

        e.g. the
        import settings of the DLL''s are changed to comply with Unity.'
